ens  and then backing off as far as you can  in this case because the officer was by  himself and he didn't have the  opportunity to use another tactic other  than deadly force um usually we'd try to  put an action team together and use less  lethal options that just in this case  didn't there wasn't enough time from the  time he dropped the backpack until the  shots were fired was 31 seconds  and we didn't get a sergeant there  that's required on this call but the  sergeant never made it to the cause too  far away and it happened too quickly  about how long from the time of the  request for police to be out there to  the time they arrived about how long of  the time period was that 12 minutes  he was threatening his family  yes he threatened him in the past and  was trying to break into the house with  the knife  and  it sounded like to me that the dad told  them i called the police  and he went through the backyard jumped  the wall onto broadbent and that's where  we found him  thanks everybody i really appreciate you  guys coming out here today  thank you for asking really appreciate  it  two swat officers were injured this  morning  serving a search warrant one was treated  and released  the other one was shot three times  he's still in surgery and i don't have  an update but he is expected to survive  i did see him earlier today this morning  he is in good spirits  thank you  um  you

